sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Person
    participant B as Authy
    participant C as Channel
    participant L as Level
    participant G as Grant
    A->>B: open Authy
    B-->>A: ask for a proof
    A->>C: choose email
    C-->>A: one-time link
    A->>B: confirm the link
    B->>L: record L2 · email
    A->>C: choose Telegram
    C-->>A: bot challenge
    A->>B: confirm the code
    alt wrong code
      B-->>A: retry · level unchanged
    else correct code
      B->>L: record L3 · Telegram
    end
    Note over B,L: publishing unlocks at L3
    A->>B: add phone and bio later
    B->>G: sign the identity bundle
    G-->>A: levels and grant ready
